135 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 267 0 R
/E (Does the toe of the hind hoof drag? If the answer is yes, do they both drag, or just one side? Look at the hock movement next, particularly at the trot. Do the hocks flex well, or differently from each other? Much less frequently, you will see a front toe drag.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [7]
>>
endobj
