137 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 268 0 R
/E (Using soft eyes, look at the relative grace and swing of the limbs. Break the body first into quadrants, then into smaller sections. Do not forget the barrel, there is often an enormous amount of constriction in the barrel.)
/Pg 15 0 R
/K [9]
>>
endobj
